"# Wonderbly Design System & UI Token Specification\n\n> **Source**: Extracted live from Wonderbly's Storefront, PDP, Creation Flow, and Preview Spread Reader (September 2026).\n> **Architecture**: CSS `@layer tokens`, `@layer components`, Next.js CSS Modules (`*.module.css`), Astro component styling.\n\n---\n\n## Executive Summary & Design System Philosophy\n\nWonderbly's visual design language is characterized by an **editorial, storybook-grade aesthetic** that bridges high-end print publishing with digital responsiveness:\n- **Typography pairing**: A characterful serif display face (**Rza**) for warmth and bookish charm, paired with a clean, highly legible geometric grotesk sans-serif (**Atak**) for UI controls and reading body copy.\n- **Warm tactile surfaces**: Off-white and cream background tones (Kraft Paper `#FDF8F1` / `#FBF4E8`) replicating physical warm book paper rather than sterile clinical digital whites (`#FFFFFF`).\n- **Sharp editorial geometry**: `border-radius: 0px` or minimal `2px` for cards, containers, inputs, and modals, creating an intentional, crisp editorial frame around colorful book art.\n- **Physical page realism**: Multi-layered spine drop shadows combining warm gold undertones (`rgba(129, 92, 24, 0.12)`) with deep contact occlusion shadows and directional multi-stop gradients that simulate physical book paper curvature and gutter crease depth.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Color Palette Tokens\n\nWonderbly defines its token palette inside `@layer tokens { :root { ... } }` with semantic aliases used in `@layer components`.\n\n### 1.1 Brand & Neutral Colors\n\n| Token Name | CSS Variable | Hex Code | RGB | HSL / Visual Role |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Sharpie** | `--color-sharpie` | `#23231E` | `rgb(35, 35, 30)` | Primary dark text, primary CTA button background, high-contrast borders |\n| **Sharpie 80** | `--color-sharpie-80` | `#555553` | `rgb(85, 85, 83)` | Secondary text, subtle subheadings |\n| **Sharpie 60** | `--color-sharpie-60` | `#7B7B78` | `rgb(123, 123, 120)` | Micro-copy, character limit counters, inactive controls, overlay color (`rgba(124, 124, 121, 0.75)`) |\n| **Sharpie 30** | `--color-sharpie-30` | `#BDBDBB` | `rgb(189, 189, 187)` | Input borders (`2px solid`), drawer inactive borders, modal divider lines |\n| **Sharpie 20** | `--color-sharpie-20` | `#D9D9D7` | `rgb(217, 217, 215)` | Subtle container borders, header bottom line |\n| **Sharpie 10** | `--color-sharpie-10` | `#E9E9E9` | `rgb(233, 233, 233)` | Dividers, table borders, inactive pagination dots (`#EFEFEF`) |\n| **Bright Smile**| `--color-bright-smile` | `#FFFFFF` | `rgb(255, 255, 255)` | Pure white, card backgrounds, modal container cards, button text on dark |\n| **Kraft Paper** | `--color-kraft-paper` | `#FBF4E8` | `rgb(251, 244, 232)` | Warm parchment base, cart button text, book page image placeholders |\n| **Kraft Paper 60** | `--color-kraft-paper-60` | `#FDF8F1` | `rgb(253, 248, 241)` | Main preview reader page background, modal content area background |\n| **Kraft Paper 30** | `--color-kraft-paper-30` | `#FEFCF8` | `rgb(254, 252, 248)` | Lightest parchment highlight |\n| **Grid Line Tint** | N/A | `#F9F0DF` | `rgb(249, 240, 223)` | 1px repeating background grid pattern on preview reader canvas (`8px 8px` repeat) |\n\n### 1.2 Accent & Brand Feature Colors\n\n| Token Name | CSS Variable | Hex Code | RGB | Functional Usage |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Racing Green** | `--color-racing-green` | `#1E5751` | `rgb(30, 87, 81)` | Signature deep teal brand color, announcement promo bar, active layout selector toggle, active radio button indicator |\n| **Racing Green 60** | `--color-racing-green-60` | `#789A97` | `rgb(120, 154, 151)` | Secondary green tint |\n| **Racing Green 30** | `--color-racing-green-30` | `#BBCDCB` | `rgb(187, 205, 203)` | Soft sage background for promo items |\n| **Mustard** | `--color-mustard` | `#FFD15A` | `rgb(255, 209, 90)` | Signature golden yellow, hero badge, primary marketing CTA accent |\n| **Mustard 60** | `--color-mustard-60` | `#FFE39C` | `rgb(255, 227, 156)` | Secondary gold tint |\n| **Mustard 30** | `--color-mustard-30` | `#FFF1CE` | `rgb(255, 241, 206)` | Soft gold badge background |\n| **Butter** | `--color-butter` | `#FFEBA3` | `rgb(255, 235, 163)` | Warm creamy yellow highlight |\n| **Tinkerbell** | `--color-tinkerbell` | `#C1F1A1` | `rgb(193, 241, 161)` | Bright lime/mint green, discount badges, upsell chips |\n| **Tinkerbell 60** | `--color-tinkerbell-60` | `#DAF7C6` | `rgb(218, 247, 198)` | Promo code tag background (`#DAF7C6`) in checkout & cart |\n| **Lily Pad** | `--color-lily-pad` | `#9FE778` | `rgb(159, 231, 120)` | Electric lime accent, secondary tertiary button border |\n| **Cherry Cola** | `--color-cherry-cola` | `#851926` | `rgb(133, 25, 38)` | Deep burgundy, error validation border (`[aria-invalid=\"true\"]`), warning notices |\n| **Ketchup** | `--color-ketchup` | `#D8460D` | `rgb(216, 70, 13)` | Vibrant orange/red accent, sale banners |\n| **Paper Boat** | `--color-paper-boat` | `#6AB5F4` | `rgb(106, 181, 244)` | Focus ring shadow color (`0 0 0 4px #6AB5F4`) |\n| **Blueberry** | `--color-blueberry` | `#0049AC` | `rgb(0, 73, 172)` | Deep royal blue button variant |\n| **Bubble Bath** | `--color-bubble-bath` | `#D0EBFF` | `rgb(208, 235, 255)` | Soft blue banner / notification background |\n| **Princess** | `--color-princess` | `#CEBCFA` | `rgb(206, 188, 250)` | Lavender theme accent background |\n| **Pinking Shears**| `--color-pinking-shears`| `#E98EC1` | `rgb(233, 142, 193)` | Playful pink theme accent |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Typography System\n\n### 2.1 Font Families\n- **Headings Font**: `\"Rza\", Georgia, serif` (Font family token: `--font-family-heading`, Next.js css variable `--font-rza`).\n  - Available weights loaded: `300` (Light), `400` (Regular), `500` (Medium), `600` (SemiBold), `700` (Bold), `900` (Black).\n- **Body & UI Font**: `\"Atak\", Arial, sans-serif` (Font family token: `--font-family-body`, Next.js css variable `--font-atak`).\n  - Available weights loaded: `300`, `400` (Regular), `500` (Medium), `600` (SemiBold), `700` (Bold), `900` (Black) + italics.\n\n### 2.2 Heading Typography Specifications\n\n| Element / Level | Token Name | Font | Weight | Size | Line Height | Letter Spacing | Color |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **H1 (Hero / PDP)** | `--font-heading-4xl-regular` | Rza | 500 / 400 | `36px` (2.25rem) | `43.2px` (1.2 / 1.16) | normal | `#23231E` |\n| **H1 (Storefront / Checkout)** | `--font-heading-3xl-regular` | Rza | 500 / 400 | `30px` (1.875rem)| `36px` (1.2) | normal | `#23231E` / `#1E5751` |\n| **H2 (Section Titles)** | `--font-heading-2xl-regular` | Rza | 500 / 400 | `24px`- `28px` | `30px` - `42px` | normal | `#23231E` |\n| **H2 (Modal Title / Dedication)** | `SchemaFormModal_title__nSlqS`| Rza | 400 | `24px` (1.5rem) | `30px` (1.25) | normal | `#23231E` |\n| **H3 (Subsections / Accordions)**| `--font-heading-l-semibold` | Atak | 600 | `20px` (1.25rem) | `28px` (1.4) | normal | `#23231E` |\n| **H4 (Checkout Section Titles)**| `CheckoutForm-sectionTitle` | Atak | 600 | `16px` - `18px` | `22px` - `26px` | normal | `#23231E` |\n| **H5 (Product Card Titles)** | `ProductCard-heading` | Atak | 600 | `16px` (1.0rem) | `22px` (1.375) | normal | `#23231E` |\n\n### 2.3 Body Text & Micro-Copy Specifications\n\n| Role / Context | Token Name | Font | Weight | Size | Line Height | Letter Spacing | Color |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Body Large / Form Inputs** | `--font-body-m-regular` | Atak | 400 | `16px` (1rem) | `22px` / `24px` | normal | `#23231E` |\n| **Body Semibold / Buttons** | `--font-body-m-semibold` | Atak | 500 / 600 | `16px` (1rem) | `20px` / `22px` | normal | `#FFFFFF` / `#23231E` |\n| **Body Bold** | `--font-body-m-bold` | Atak | 700 | `16px` (1rem) | `22px` (1.375) | normal | `#23231E` |\n| **Body Small / Banners** | `--font-body-s-regular` | Atak | 400 | `14px` (0.875rem)| `20px` - `21px` | normal | `#FFFFFF` / `#23231E` |\n| **Body Small Semibold** | `--font-body-s-semibold` | Atak | 600 | `14px` (0.875rem)| `20px` | normal | `#23231E` |\n| **Character Counter Micro-copy**| `MultiLineText_charactersLeft`| Atak | 700 | `14px` | `18px` | normal | `#7B7B78` |\n| **Eyebrow / Kicker Badge** | `TieredMessaging-eyebrow` | Atak | 700 | `12px` (0.75rem)| `18px` (1.5) | `0.6px` (uppercase) | `#1E5751` |\n| **Micro-copy 2XS** | `--font-body-2xs-regular` | Atak | 400 | `12px` (0.75rem)| `18px` (1.5) | normal | `#7B7B78` |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Card & Container Radii and Box-Shadow Elevations\n\n### 3.1 Border Radius Scale\n\nWonderbly avoids heavily rounded cards for core book content to maintain an editorial, bookstore-like physical realism:\n- **Buttons (Storefront & PDP)**: `border-radius: 2px` (`Button-Button-ae419`). Minimal softened corners.\n- **Buttons (Customization & Reader)**: `border-radius: 0px` (`PrimaryButton_primary__hrgvW`). Ultra-sharp, crisp digital tool buttons.\n- **Text Inputs & Textareas**: `border-radius: 0px` with `border: 2px solid #BDBDBB` (focus ring: `0 0 0 4px #6AB5F4`).\n- **Product Cards & Banners**: `border-radius: 0px` (`Card-root-e8ed8`).\n- **Book Page Illustrations**: `border-radius: 2px` (`PageImage_page__JxygX`). Mimics paper sheet edge trimming.\n- **Pills, Badges & Filter Chips**: `border-radius: 20px` or `9999px` (`RangeRail-pill-012cf`, `padding: 0 20px`, `height: 30px`).\n- **Modal & Drawer Container**: `border-radius: 0px` (on both desktop dialogs and full-screen mobile drawers).\n\n### 3.2 Box Shadow Elevations\n\n1. **Focus Ring Shadow**:\n   ```css\n   --focus-shadow-color: #6ab5f4;\n   --focus-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--focus-shadow-color);\n   ```\n2. **Modal Dialog Elevation (Desktop)**:\n   ```css\n   box-shadow: rgba(124, 124, 121, 0.75) 0px 8px 48px 0px;\n   ```\n3. **Book Spread Realistic Multi-Layer Spine Drop Shadow**:\n   Applied to `.PageImage_page__JxygX::before`:\n   ```css\n   box-shadow: \n     rgba(129, 92, 24, 0.12) 0px 13px 27px -5px,\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.30) 0px 8px 16px -8px,\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03) 0px -6px 16px -6px;\n   ```\n   - **Layer 1** (`rgba(129, 92, 24, 0.12)`): Ambient warm gold/ochre shadow bounce reflecting off warm kraft paper.\n   - **Layer 2** (`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.30)`): Direct downward occlusion shadow from the physical book block height.\n   - **Layer 3** (`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)`): Subtle upward diffuse glow preventing harsh contrast against light backgrounds.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Preview Spread Reader Specifications\n\nThe preview spread reader is Wonderbly's core conversion and customization engine.\n\n### 4.1 Canvas & Aspect Ratio\n- **Canvas Background**:\n  ```css\n  background: \n    linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(249, 240, 223) 1px, transparent 0px) -1px -1px / 8px 8px,\n    rgb(253, 248, 241);\n  ```\n  A subtle 8px grid pattern with warm tint (`#F9F0DF`) over parchment cream (`#FDF8F1`).\n- **Page Aspect Ratio**:\n  - Exact CSS property: `aspect-ratio: 1.38667 / 1` (~ 25:18 ratio, or approximately 16:11.5 landscape format).\n  - Single page dimension: `599.992px x 432.68px`.\n  - Double page spread: Two `1.38667 / 1` pages side-by-side inside a 2-column CSS Grid (`1200px` max width).\n\n### 4.2 Page Turn & Spine Shading Gradients\nWonderbly creates photorealistic depth in CSS using `::after` pseudo-elements layered above the book page images:\n\n1. **Left Page Curvature & Spine Shading** (`.PageImage_page-left__YbgDj::after`):\n   ```css\n   background: linear-gradient(\n     270deg,\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10) 0%,\n     rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) min(20px, 3.5%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04) min(42px, 7.5%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.00) min(146px, 26%)\n   );\n   ```\n2. **Right Page Curvature & Spine Shading** (`.PageImage_page-right__aH9gt::after`):\n   ```css\n   background: linear-gradient(\n     90deg,\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10) 0%,\n     rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10) min(20px, 3.5%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04) min(42px, 7.5%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.00) min(146px, 26%)\n   );\n   ```\n3. **Hardcover Spine Gutter Crease** (`.PageImage_cover-left__wxoSv::after` & `.PageImage_cover-right__0A_6J::after`):\n   A realistic 7-stop indentation recreating the grooved hinge of a hardcover book:\n   ```css\n   background: linear-gradient(\n     90deg,\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.20) 0%,\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.20) min(3px, 0.64%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.00) min(6px, 1.04%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.00) min(17px, 3.70%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.20) min(22px, 4.77%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.20) min(24px, 4.99%),\n     rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.00) min(31px, 6.21%)\n   );\n   ```\n\n### 4.3 View Modes & Layout Selector Controls\n- **Toggle Group**: `.LayoutSelector_layoutButton__qr7Vj`\n  - Inactive State: `background: #FFFFFF; color: #7B7B78; border: 1px solid #1E5751; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; padding: 12px 8px 8px;`\n  - Active State (`.LayoutSelector_active__qkEVM`): `background: #1E5751; color: #FFFFFF; border: none;`\n- **Page Nudge Animation Timing**:\n  ```css\n  @keyframes Pages_nudge__r7ymb {\n    0% { transform: translateY(0px); }\n    20% { transform: translateY(-20px); }\n    32.5% { transform: translateY(-20px); }\n    50% { transform: translateY(0px); }\n    100% { transform: translateY(0px); }\n  }\n  ```\n  A subtle upward lift to indicate interactivity when a spread is selected or nudged.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Mobile Drawer & Modal Customization Flow\n\nThe customization flow for Dedication, Giver Name, Characters, and Cover Color switches between an elevated centered modal on desktop and a slide-over/slide-up drawer on mobile.\n\n### 5.1 Overlay & Modal Classes\n- **Backdrop Overlay**: `.Modal_overlay__zNfj3`\n  - Desktop: `position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(124, 124, 121, 0.75); padding: 48px 0; z-index: 4; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start;`\n  - Mobile (< 48rem / 768px): `padding: 0;`\n- **Modal Container**: `.Modal_modal___7ger`\n  - Desktop: `max-width: 36rem (576px); height: auto; max-height: 100%; border-radius: 0px; box-shadow: rgba(124, 124, 121, 0.75) 0px 8px 48px 0px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;`\n  - Mobile: `width: 100%; height: 100%; max-height: none; border-radius: 0px; box-shadow: none;`\n- **Slide-up Animation**:\n  ```css\n  @keyframes Modal_slide-up__zxwAv {\n    0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); }\n  }\n  animation: 0.2s ease 0s 1 normal none running Modal_slide-up__zxwAv;\n  ```\n  Duration: `0.2s` (200ms), Timing function: `ease`, Distance: `translateY(10px)`.\n\n### 5.2 Form Components & Dedication Editor\n- **Header**: `.Modal_header__YVwpn` (`background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #BDBDBB; padding: 16px 24px;`).\n  - Close/Cancel button: `.Modal_cancelButton__jlMMT` (`background: transparent; color: #23231E; font-size: 16px; padding: 8px; margin: -8px;`).\n- **Title**: `.SchemaFormModal_title__nSlqS` (`font-family: Rza; font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; color: #23231E;`).\n- **Subtitle**: `.SchemaFormModal_subtitle__H7kja` (`font-family: Atak; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; color: #23231E;`).\n- **Multiline Textarea**: `.MultiLineText_textarea__yXR42`\n  - `border: 2px solid #BDBDBB; border-radius: 0px; background: #FFFFFF; font-family: Atak; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px; padding: 8px;`\n  - Active/Focus: `outline: none; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #6AB5F4;`\n- **Character Counter**: `.MultiLineText_charactersLeft__JOrw_`\n  - `font-family: Atak; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #7B7B78;`\n- **Sticky Actions Bar**: `.SchemaFormModal_stickyActions__OUroR`\n  - `position: sticky; bottom: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border-top: 1px solid #BDBDBB; padding: 1rem calc(1rem + env(safe-area-inset-right)) calc(1rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) calc(1rem + env(safe-area-inset-left)); z-index: 3;`\n- **Action Buttons in Drawer**:\n  - Primary Submit / Continue: `.PrimaryButton_primary__hrgvW` (`background: #23231E; color: #FFFFFF; height: 48px; border-radius: 0px; font-family: Atak; font-size: 16px;`).\n  - Hover state: `background-color: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #23231E; color: #23231E;`.\n\n### 5.3 Bottom Drawers Navigation Bar (Preview Viewport)\n- **Bar Container**: `.Drawers_drawers__Mi8Al`\n  - `display: flex; flex-direction: row; gap: 12px; overflow-x: auto; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 12px 16px;`\n- **Drawer Trigger Tab**: `.Drawer_drawer__XtG2B`\n  - Incomplete state: `border: 1px solid #BDBDBB; border-radius: 0px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 12px;`\n  - Completed state (`.Drawer_complete__m_18q`): `border-color: #23231E;`\n  - Label: `font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; color: #000000;`\n  - Status tick / value: `font-size: 14px; color: #7B7B78;`\n\n---\n\n## 6. Layout Grids & Responsive Breakpoints\n\n### 6.1 Layout Tokens\n```css\n:root {\n  --layout-content-width: min(80rem, calc(100vw - 2rem)); /* 1280px max */\n  --layout-gutter: 1rem;\n  --layout-template: minmax(1rem, 1fr) var(--layout-content-width) minmax(1rem, 1fr);\n  --layout-col-center: 2;\n  --layout-col-full: 1 / span 3;\n  --layout-inline: max(1rem, calc(50vw - var(--layout-content-width) / 2));\n  --site-header-height: 150px;\n}\n```\n\n### 6.2 Responsive Breakpoints\n\n| Breakpoint Target | Media Query | Layout Adjustments |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Mobile Compact** | `(max-width: 352px)` | Minimum padding (`8px`), smaller drawer tags |\n| **Mobile Standard**| `(max-width: 480px)` | Single column grid, full-width CTA buttons, hidden layout switcher |\n| **Phablet / Tablet**| `(max-width: 768px)` / `max-width: 48rem` | Full-screen modal drawers (`width: 100%; height: 100%`), bottom drawer bar scrolls horizontally |\n| **Desktop Medium** | `(min-width: 778px)` / `min-width: 48rem` | Centered 36rem dialog with `rgba(124, 124, 121, 0.75)` backdrop, 2-page spread enabled |\n| **Desktop Large**  | `(min-width: 1040px)` | 4-column product rail, sticky customization preview header |\n| **Wide Desktop**   | `(min-width: 1280px)` | Max container `80rem` (`1280px`), side gutters centered automatically |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Tailwind CSS Configuration Guide for Personalized Storybooks\n\nTo replicate Wonderbly's exact aesthetic in a Next.js / Tailwind project:\n\n```javascript\n// tailwind.config.js\nmodule.exports = {\n  theme: {\n    screens: {\n      'xs': '480px',\n      'sm': '576px',\n      'md': '768px',\n      'lg': '1040px',\n      'xl': '1280px',\n    },\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        sharpie: {\n          DEFAULT: '#23231E',\n          10: '#E9E9E9',\n          20: '#D9D9D7',\n          30: '#BDBDBB',\n          60: '#7B7B78',\n          80: '#555553',\n        },\n        kraft: {\n          DEFAULT: '#FBF4E8',\n          30: '#FEFCF8',\n          60: '#FDF8F1',\n        },\n        racingGreen: {\n          DEFAULT: '#1E5751',\n          30: '#BBCDCB',\n          60: '#789A97',\n        },\n        mustard: {\n          DEFAULT: '#FFD15A',\n          30: '#FFF1CE',\n          60: '#FFE39C',\n        },\n        butter: '#FFEBA3',\n        tinkerbell: {\n          DEFAULT: '#C1F1A1',\n          30: '#E2F8D6',\n          60: '#DAF7C6',\n        },\n        lilyPad: '#9FE778',\n        cherryCola: '#851926',\n        ketchup: '#D8460D',\n        paperBoat: '#6AB5F4',\n        blueberry: '#0049AC',\n        bubbleBath: '#D0EBFF',\n        princess: '#CEBCFA',\n        pinkingShears: '#E98EC1',\n      },\n      fontFamily: {\n        heading: ['\"Rza\"', 'Georgia', 'serif'],\n        body: ['\"Atak\"', 'Arial', 'sans-serif'],\n      },\n      borderRadius: {\n        'xs': '2px',\n        'pill': '20px',\n      },\n      boxShadow: {\n        'focus': '0 0 0 4px #6AB5F4',\n        'modal': '0 8px 48px 0 rgba(124, 124, 121, 0.75)',\n        'book-spine': 'rgba(129, 92, 24, 0.12) 0px 13px 27px -5px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 8px 16px -8px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03) 0px -6px 16px -6px',\n      },\n      aspectRatio: {\n        'book-page': '1.38667 / 1',\n      },\n      animation: {\n        'slide-up': 'slideUp 0.2s ease-out forwards',\n        'page-nudge': 'pageNudge 1s ease-in-out',\n      },\n      keyframes: {\n        slideUp: {\n          '0%': { opacity: '0', transform: 'translateY(10px)' },\n          '100%': { opacity: '1', transform: 'translateY(0)' },\n        },\n        pageNudge: {\n          '0%': { transform: 'translateY(0px)' },\n          '20%': { transform: 'translateY(-20px)' },\n          '32.5%': { transform: 'translateY(-20px)' },\n          '50%': { transform: 'translateY(0px)' },\n          '100%': { transform: 'translateY(0px)' },\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  },\n};\n```\n"